      en: "Millennium Marine Park is a marine protected area on Christmas Island (Kiritimati) in the Line Islands of Kiribati. It covers about 80 km² along the coast. The park protects diverse marine ecosystems including coral reefs, seagrass beds, and mangroves. It is an important habitat for fish, reef sharks, manta rays, and sea turtles. Established in 2000 and named after the millennium, it is popular for diving and snorkeling, and supports sustainable resource use.",
